{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39222","headline":"寄右省李起居 · 韦庄","name":"寄右省李起居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已向鸳行接雁行，便应双拜紫薇郎。\n才闻阙下徵书急，已觉回朝草诏忙。\n白马似怜朱绂贵，彩衣遥惹御炉香。\n多慙十载游梁客，未换青襟侍素王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}